WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.174
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.175 --> 00:02.467
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION, BINGE
DRINKING, SHAMEFUL ACTS NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:02.468 --> 00:03.760
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:03.761 --> 00:04.970
DUE TO RECENT COMPLIANCE ISSUES, THE
BLACK DOT SIZE HAS BEEN INCREASED BY 5%.

00:05.971 --> 00:08.390
Sorry about the mixer the other day.

00:08.933 --> 00:10.017
Don't worry about it.

00:10.518 --> 00:12.645
They're all just a bunch of idiots.

00:12.853 --> 00:16.190
They didn't mature at all
over the summer break.

00:16.315 --> 00:18.775
Well, the summer break is short.

00:18.776 --> 00:21.487
People don't change that quickly.

00:21.946 --> 00:23.072
I guess so.

00:26.283 --> 00:27.326
What's wrong?

00:27.576 --> 00:28.994
- Ah, nothing...
- Ah, nothing...

00:29.995 --> 00:31.539
Something feels off here.

00:35.376 --> 00:37.294
- Huh?
- A monster?

00:37.419 --> 00:39.588
What kind of greeting is that?

00:39.797 --> 00:41.757
Tokki, you're here too.

00:41.882 --> 00:45.385
Sorry, you just looked like
a new species...

00:45.386 --> 00:47.846
It's hard to believe you're a mammal.

00:48.347 --> 00:48.846
I see.

00:48.847 --> 00:51.183
Don't just get convinced so easily.

00:51.433 --> 00:52.810
By the way, you two.

00:53.143 --> 00:53.811
Yes?

00:54.645 --> 00:57.106
What do you think is the purpose of life?

00:57.314 --> 00:59.483
- Someone call a doctor, please!
- Someone call a doctor, please!

01:00.693 --> 01:02.444
Have you started job hunting?

01:03.320 --> 01:06.198
Tonight, I have a meet-up
with alumni and drinks.

01:06.699 --> 01:10.536
I'm planning to prepare answers about
my future goals and self-evaluation.

01:10.744 --> 01:13.705
I heard those questions
come up a lot in interviews.

01:13.706 --> 01:14.622
I see.

01:14.623 --> 01:17.710
I guess I should start preparing too.

01:18.419 --> 01:20.963
The seniors are already
starting to job hunt, huh?

01:21.547 --> 01:24.550
We should figure out what to do
for the farewell event.

01:25.259 --> 01:27.511
I was thinking of
finding someone to consult...

01:29.805 --> 01:32.766
I have something to discuss,
can you guys gather around?

01:33.517 --> 01:35.811
Maybe I'll just ask these guys
while we're at it.

01:36.729 --> 01:37.896
What a coincidence.

01:38.022 --> 01:39.440
Actually, I have something too.

01:39.732 --> 01:42.026
Sorry, I have something I want to say too.

01:43.027 --> 01:44.028
Hmm...

01:45.029 --> 01:48.157
Well, if we can all gather, that's good.

01:52.328 --> 01:54.330
MITARAI

01:54.913 --> 01:56.749
Is this your room, Mitarai?

01:56.999 --> 01:58.375
This is my first time inside.

01:59.084 --> 02:01.754
You usually hate letting people in.

02:02.004 --> 02:03.172
Is it okay today?

02:03.339 --> 02:05.633
There has to be a time for it, at least.

02:06.091 --> 02:07.926
Well then, cheers first!

02:08.135 --> 02:09.720
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

02:14.308 --> 02:16.435
Discussing things with these idiots?

02:16.685 --> 02:19.063
It's nothing decent to say the least.

02:20.731 --> 02:22.608
Every single one of them...

02:22.900 --> 02:26.195
looks like they have
something really serious to say.

02:27.696 --> 02:29.155
When many people
ask for advice at once,

02:29.156 --> 02:29.864
THE SENIORS FROM MY CLUB
ARE ABOUT TO RETIRE

02:29.865 --> 02:31.824
the less serious issues

02:31.825 --> 02:33.618
MY JUNK IS OOZING PUStends to be brushed aside.

02:33.619 --> 02:34.119
JESUS!

02:34.328 --> 02:37.206
After all, these are just their worries.

02:37.373 --> 02:39.792
- It can't be that serious.
- So what do you want to talk about?

02:40.250 --> 02:40.709
Well...

02:41.126 --> 02:42.002
Actually, I...

02:42.544 --> 02:45.381
want to drop out of school
to become a YouTuber.

02:45.506 --> 02:46.506
- Huh?
- Huh?

02:46.507 --> 02:49.218
That's incredibly serious!

02:49.677 --> 02:51.844
That's a bold decision.

02:51.845 --> 02:53.555
Why did you think of that?

02:54.139 --> 02:57.434
I asked myself if it was okay
to just live a normal life like this.

02:57.810 --> 03:00.479
As you guys can see,
I'm quite handsome, right?

03:02.147 --> 03:03.732
I'm quite handsome, right?

03:05.234 --> 03:07.486
I'm going to keep asking
until you guys answer.

03:07.611 --> 03:08.695
Depends on the angle...

03:08.696 --> 03:09.862
Or rather on the era...

03:09.863 --> 03:11.782
Whether we happen to be blind or not...

03:11.990 --> 03:13.784
Why are you adding conditions?

03:14.368 --> 03:16.577
So what are you going to stream about?

03:16.578 --> 03:19.248
Since I haven't decided yet,
I'm asking for your advice.

03:19.373 --> 03:21.666
In short, I want to be praised.

03:21.667 --> 03:22.710
This idiot.

03:22.876 --> 03:24.628
What an annoying request.

03:25.170 --> 03:27.798
I'll just give a safe, vague answer.

03:28.590 --> 03:29.967
Hey, Nojima.

03:30.259 --> 03:32.386
Isn't that thought just a way to escape?

03:32.511 --> 03:33.011
Huh?

03:33.178 --> 03:35.639
If there's something
you want to do, just do it.

03:35.973 --> 03:38.142
But you don't need to drop out of school.

03:38.726 --> 03:40.185
You're just talking big.

03:40.310 --> 03:42.186
If you want to
make your dream come true,

03:42.187 --> 03:45.023
you should make a space
where you can pursue it, right?

03:45.149 --> 03:46.191
What do you mean?

03:46.442 --> 03:49.611
If you drop out, your parents
won't finance you, right?

03:49.903 --> 03:51.154
But if you don't do that,

03:51.155 --> 03:54.783
you can keep trying as many times
as you want without worrying.

03:55.784 --> 03:56.994
As many times as I want?

03:57.828 --> 04:01.540
Don't be impulsive.
Calm down and give it a think.

04:01.915 --> 04:03.584
Yeah, understood.

04:03.792 --> 04:06.336
Good, that's Nojima's issue sorted out.

04:06.670 --> 04:07.755
Next is...

04:07.880 --> 04:10.090
Then listen to my story.

04:10.424 --> 04:12.091
Yamamoto's turn this time.

04:12.092 --> 04:13.260
What's the matter?

04:14.428 --> 04:17.431
I... have someone I like.

04:17.890 --> 04:18.932
- Hmm...
- Hmm...

04:19.933 --> 04:21.685
- Which zoo is she at?
- Which zoo is she at?

04:21.810 --> 04:24.438
What kind of degenerate
do you think I am?!

04:24.813 --> 04:26.106
That's not it.

04:26.398 --> 04:28.108
This is the one I like.

04:28.609 --> 04:33.405
Hello everyone!
It's your virtual idol, Sakuya!

04:33.739 --> 04:35.823
- She's completely digital?!
- She's completely digital?!

04:35.824 --> 04:37.576
Well, she's 3D at least.

04:38.076 --> 04:41.662
Every time I watch her videos,
I feel energized.

04:41.663 --> 04:45.334
I realized she is the true love of my life.

04:46.168 --> 04:47.252
I see...

04:47.586 --> 04:50.589
As your friend, I support you, but...

04:51.548 --> 04:54.467
I want to marry this healing voice!

04:54.468 --> 04:55.928
- Don't say shit like that!
- Don't say shit like that!

04:57.054 --> 05:00.098
Falling in love with a voice
from the other side this time?

05:00.641 --> 05:01.308
Kouhei.

05:01.600 --> 05:04.770
Try imitating her with
that Mix Voice you did before.

05:07.314 --> 05:09.650
About that, I'm afraid I can't.

05:10.943 --> 05:13.862
Huh? Why?
You can't imitate that voice?

05:13.987 --> 05:15.112
That's not it.

05:15.113 --> 05:16.864
It's not that I can't.

05:16.865 --> 05:18.325
Then what is it?

05:18.450 --> 05:21.036
I have my own problems, too.

05:21.203 --> 05:21.787
Huh?

05:21.912 --> 05:22.955
Are you worried too?

05:23.497 --> 05:25.958
It literally just popped up.

05:26.250 --> 05:27.292
What do you mean?

05:27.751 --> 05:28.961
Listen, Yamamoto.

05:29.378 --> 05:32.506
If you don't even know what
she looks like, don't start it anyway.

05:32.756 --> 05:34.925
Firstly, the chances of even
meeting her are...

05:36.844 --> 05:39.346
KOUHEI IMAMURASakuya's true identity is me.

05:40.472 --> 05:43.934
The fuck is wrong with you guys!?

05:44.059 --> 05:46.395
That love will never ever bear fruit!

05:46.520 --> 05:48.230
I can assure you of that!

05:48.564 --> 05:50.065
How can you be so sure?

05:50.482 --> 05:52.317
Because the other party is Kouhei.

05:53.068 --> 05:56.946
Don't tell me you are going to say
she's a 2D character?

05:56.947 --> 05:58.573
She's clearly 3D.

05:58.574 --> 05:59.700
Ah, well...

06:00.033 --> 06:01.410
Well, whatever.

06:04.079 --> 06:06.957
Damn it! Why?

06:07.791 --> 06:11.335
Damn it!

06:11.336 --> 06:13.797
Why... Why?!

06:20.721 --> 06:22.889
You get me, right Imamura?

06:22.890 --> 06:25.559
That's what I want to say, Yamamoto.

06:26.018 --> 06:28.687
Well, who cares anymore.

06:29.646 --> 06:32.024
You can't lose your virginity
to a 2D girl anyway.

06:32.274 --> 06:33.275
DO YOU WANT TO DELETE THIS APP?
CANCEL / DELETE

06:33.984 --> 06:35.777
This is where it ends.

06:37.487 --> 06:38.906
That's a quick turn of face.

06:39.239 --> 06:41.073
Are you betraying me, Yamamoto?

06:41.074 --> 06:43.784
We were never
on the same team to begin with.

06:43.785 --> 06:45.578
You bastard.

06:45.579 --> 06:48.248
Good, that's a bunch of problems solved.

06:48.457 --> 06:49.333
Next is...

06:50.000 --> 06:52.711
My issue is way more serious than yours.

06:53.253 --> 06:54.254
Is that so?

06:54.713 --> 06:57.382
The truth is, my childhood friend Rie...

06:58.467 --> 07:01.094
caught me cheating,
and now I'm about to be killed.

07:01.219 --> 07:03.639
I'm going to shatter your jaw.

07:03.931 --> 07:04.848
Crack crack.

07:05.641 --> 07:06.600
Boring.

07:06.725 --> 07:07.726
Don't care.

07:07.976 --> 07:11.562
Tch, call the child abuse hotline.

07:11.563 --> 07:13.523
Take this seriously!

07:14.024 --> 07:15.524
Apologize by dying.

07:15.525 --> 07:17.443
Committing seppuku's manly as well.

07:17.444 --> 07:19.320
How about a public parade of shame?

07:19.321 --> 07:22.199
Go bungee jumping without a cord
to prove your innocence.

07:22.824 --> 07:23.992
You guys...

07:24.618 --> 07:27.329
I only exchanged contact info with her!

07:27.788 --> 07:28.955
That's reason enough.

07:28.956 --> 07:29.789
Hurry up and die.

07:29.790 --> 07:30.958
Die quickly.

07:31.124 --> 07:32.667
You better be dead soon.

07:32.668 --> 07:33.919
You're so cruel!

07:34.252 --> 07:36.797
Can you guys just chill for a second?

07:36.964 --> 07:37.839
- Huh?
- Huh?

07:38.006 --> 07:41.885
Since long ago, once Rie makes up
her mind, she goes through with it.

07:42.636 --> 07:43.720
So what?

07:43.929 --> 07:46.722
You picked the wrong crowd
to show off your relationship.

07:46.723 --> 07:48.724
Seems like you really want to die.

07:48.725 --> 07:50.060
I told her...

07:50.602 --> 07:53.897
that you guys forced me to do it.

07:54.022 --> 07:56.273
- Why did you drag us into it!?
- Why did you drag us into it!?

07:56.274 --> 07:57.442
Please help me!

07:57.693 --> 08:00.112
She's almost here!

08:00.320 --> 08:01.612
Don't mess with us!

08:01.613 --> 08:04.073
No wonder you suddenly
let us borrow your room.

08:04.074 --> 08:06.743
You're planning to set us up
from the very beginning!

08:09.204 --> 08:10.371
Get out!

08:10.372 --> 08:11.873
Go to hell!

08:12.082 --> 08:14.626
You cold-blooded bastards!

08:24.011 --> 08:24.803
Hey.

08:25.846 --> 08:27.222
Yuu-oniichan.

08:28.557 --> 08:31.101
W-What... What is it?

08:31.768 --> 08:36.106
I told you not to talk
to other girls, didn't I?

08:37.107 --> 08:37.566
Uh...

08:38.275 --> 08:40.485
I think so...

08:40.861 --> 08:46.074
Then why didn't you listen to me?

08:46.491 --> 08:47.701
Wait, wait, hold on.

08:47.909 --> 08:49.870
That's a coworker
from my part-time job.

08:49.995 --> 08:52.497
Exchanging contact info
is completely normal.

08:53.582 --> 08:55.667
That's the first time I've heard of that.

08:57.627 --> 09:00.714
I said if you betray me again,
your jaw is done for, didn't I?

09:08.180 --> 09:10.223
Now what?

09:10.390 --> 09:12.059
What else?

09:12.601 --> 09:15.145
His jaw gets crushed and it's game over.

09:15.479 --> 09:16.480
No, wait.

09:16.646 --> 09:18.106
What's up, Kitahara?

09:18.356 --> 09:19.524
Is it that thing again?

09:19.941 --> 09:22.235
Are you sensing the "scum" aura again?

09:22.569 --> 09:23.236
Yeah.

09:23.737 --> 09:25.071
No doubt about it.

09:25.072 --> 09:27.699
What is up with
those senses of yours anyway?

09:28.575 --> 09:30.368
- Rie.
- What?

09:30.911 --> 09:35.957
Uh... well... that is... um...

09:37.125 --> 09:39.002
Let's get married!

09:47.052 --> 09:47.677
Is that so?

09:53.183 --> 09:54.142
Good boy.

09:59.731 --> 10:01.817
YUU MITARAII want to ask for your advice again.

10:03.068 --> 10:06.237
Hey, things have gone past
the point of no return.

10:06.238 --> 10:07.656
Save me, aren't we friends?

10:08.115 --> 10:09.032
Sigh...

10:09.449 --> 10:10.241
PLEASE SAVE ME

10:10.242 --> 10:11.868
His notifications are so loud.

10:12.577 --> 10:15.247
Just mute any updates from this guy.

10:15.664 --> 10:16.540
Makes sense.

10:30.137 --> 10:32.555
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

10:32.556 --> 10:35.766
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3To a city far away, what do you say?

10:35.767 --> 10:38.185
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

10:38.186 --> 10:41.731
To a city far away, what do you say?

10:45.819 --> 10:47.695
Wait a sec, another heatwave?

10:47.696 --> 10:49.446
Temperatures are rising... Huh?!

10:49.447 --> 10:52.616
Our original plans are
totally busted, what now?

10:52.617 --> 10:55.452
But honestly, I'm getting so hyped

10:55.453 --> 10:58.122
Alright, let's roll up
our sleeves and dive in

10:58.123 --> 10:59.915
Rub your sleepy eyes and jump up

10:59.916 --> 11:01.333
Grab the usual shades

11:01.334 --> 11:04.253
Check your gear: Iced coffee, thermos

11:04.254 --> 11:06.922
Clear blue skies, just a trick of summer

11:06.923 --> 11:10.051
The booming speakers
keep calling my name

11:10.427 --> 11:12.888
Even now, I still believe

11:15.807 --> 11:17.766
In unexpected encounters

11:17.767 --> 11:20.352
And the miracles of this season

11:20.353 --> 11:23.606
Summer brings
those swing swing emotions

11:23.607 --> 11:26.358
Ah, even if I get a little carried away

11:26.359 --> 11:31.572
On my mind,
I've only been searching for you

11:31.573 --> 11:37.536
Let the south wind blow you here,
just as you are

11:37.537 --> 11:42.209
Under the blue sky, hold me tight

11:43.043 --> 11:48.506
I want to dream
a summer dream with you

11:59.476 --> 12:00.644
It's so hot.

12:01.478 --> 12:04.481
Who knew the AC would break down.

12:12.989 --> 12:13.864
Dammit!

12:13.865 --> 12:15.408
I can't take this anymore!

12:15.700 --> 12:17.493
I already ate all the ice cream.

12:17.494 --> 12:19.663
Is there anything cold left?

12:20.413 --> 12:22.165
Ah, what's this?

12:25.168 --> 12:27.254
Come to think of it, those guys...

12:27.963 --> 12:29.297
The alcohol stays here.

12:29.464 --> 12:31.466
Keep it in the freezer for me.

12:31.716 --> 12:33.260
They said that and left it.

12:34.552 --> 12:39.015
To be in the freezer and not freeze,
just how strong is this liquor?

12:47.691 --> 12:48.732
No, no way.

12:48.733 --> 12:51.152
I'd die if I drank this.

12:57.409 --> 12:58.325
YAMAMOTO'S JUNK

12:58.326 --> 13:00.453
DIAMETER

13:10.338 --> 13:12.590
This much beer should be enough, right?

13:12.966 --> 13:13.883
Yep.

13:14.134 --> 13:16.553
Buy too much and
there'll be no place to store it.

13:17.053 --> 13:19.723
In that case, let's get
five more bottles of Spirytus.

13:19.848 --> 13:21.975
- Let's buy their whole stock.
- Let's buy their whole stock.

13:22.267 --> 13:23.560
I knew it.

13:25.812 --> 13:26.646
Who is it?

13:26.855 --> 13:28.356
Oh, it's for me.

13:28.940 --> 13:30.483
YAMAMOTO

13:30.692 --> 13:32.193
What's up, Yamamoto?

13:32.736 --> 13:33.903
Sorry, Kitahara.

13:34.654 --> 13:36.196
What's with you all of a sudden?

13:36.197 --> 13:39.159
About the liquor
you guys left the other day.

13:40.285 --> 13:41.161
What about it?

13:41.494 --> 13:42.536
YAMAMOTO

13:42.537 --> 13:44.122
It's probably undrinkable now.

13:44.539 --> 13:45.123
Huh?

13:45.457 --> 13:47.042
Did you chug it all by yourself?

13:47.625 --> 13:48.710
No.

13:48.877 --> 13:50.211
Then did you spill it?

13:50.545 --> 13:51.421
Not that either.

13:51.588 --> 13:53.048
Then what happened?

13:53.757 --> 13:54.799
Well...

13:55.467 --> 13:56.760
About that...

13:57.469 --> 13:58.386
I can't say.

13:58.553 --> 13:59.846
What do you mean?

14:00.638 --> 14:02.349
That's the gist of it.

14:02.766 --> 14:04.059
Huh? Hey!

14:07.479 --> 14:08.688
I'm screwed.

14:09.689 --> 14:12.232
I suddenly remembered that
if you cool that part,

14:12.233 --> 14:14.026
LITTLE KNOWN, HEATSTROKE PREVENTION
your whole body gets cool, and did it...

14:14.027 --> 14:15.278
THE COMPLETE ART OF COOLING
YOUR JUNK - THE JUNK COOLING BOARD

14:15.403 --> 14:17.821
Anyway, I can't leave it like this forever.

14:17.822 --> 14:19.449
I'll have to pull it out.

14:19.741 --> 14:21.743
YAMAMOTO'S JUNK

14:24.287 --> 14:26.247
YAMAMOTO

14:27.332 --> 14:28.416
Yamamoto?

14:28.666 --> 14:30.334
What was your call about earlier...

14:30.335 --> 14:31.544
Cut the crap.

14:31.753 --> 14:33.505
Just answer my question.

14:34.422 --> 14:36.299
What's inside this?

14:36.466 --> 14:37.842
It's Spirytus.

14:40.887 --> 14:42.847
Hey, what's wrong?

14:43.390 --> 14:44.516
Consider me...

14:45.183 --> 14:46.142
dead.

14:46.267 --> 14:48.353
Hey, what the hell is going on?

14:52.065 --> 14:56.194
Why wasn't it rubbing alcohol, but
something much more terrifying like this?

14:59.864 --> 15:02.116
Either way, I need to take it out ASAP.

15:02.117 --> 15:04.743
It'll sting a little,
I just have to bite down and pull.

15:04.744 --> 15:05.829
Heave-ho!

15:06.079 --> 15:09.499
Alcohol absorbs slowly in the stomach.

15:09.624 --> 15:11.583
But if it enters the mucous membranes,

15:11.584 --> 15:13.919
in the small intestine,
the absorption rate spikes.

15:13.920 --> 15:17.173
Blood alcohol concentration
also increases rapidly.

15:17.298 --> 15:18.257
NO MEDICAL BASISIn short,

15:18.258 --> 15:19.758
absorbing it
through mucous membranes

15:19.759 --> 15:21.928
will get a person
unusually drunk very quickly.

15:24.848 --> 15:37.360
THIS IS EXTREMELY DANGEROUS.
ABSOLUTELY DO NOT IMITATE THIS. SERIOUSLY!

15:37.944 --> 15:38.903
So embarrassing.

15:39.696 --> 15:41.864
This is the most humiliating way
to get drunk.

15:41.865 --> 15:43.532
YAMAMOTO'S JUNK

15:43.533 --> 15:44.992
Now is not the time to be drunk!

15:44.993 --> 15:46.285
Maybe if I cut the bottle...

15:46.286 --> 15:47.078
DING DONG

15:49.414 --> 15:51.458
Sorry for making you take a detour.

15:51.583 --> 15:53.084
This much is nothing.

15:53.209 --> 15:54.711
It's on the way anyway.

15:55.211 --> 15:57.130
Hey, what's wrong?

15:57.672 --> 15:58.547
He's not coming out.

15:58.548 --> 15:59.923
That's weird.

15:59.924 --> 16:02.427
Man, it's really hot today.

16:02.635 --> 16:03.553
Sure is.

16:03.761 --> 16:06.598
That bastard, why at a time like this...

16:36.920 --> 16:39.755
Sounds like someone is
writhing in agony in there!

16:39.756 --> 16:41.216
You okay in there, Yamamoto!?

16:55.522 --> 16:56.981
It stopped.

16:57.524 --> 16:58.525
Is he okay?

16:58.900 --> 16:59.817
Iori!

17:00.026 --> 17:01.777
Contact the manager for the spare key!

17:01.778 --> 17:02.487
Got it.

17:08.201 --> 17:10.036
T-This is...

17:16.626 --> 17:17.460
Yep.

17:17.835 --> 17:19.044
So that's what it is.

17:19.045 --> 17:20.128
No mistake about it.

17:20.129 --> 17:22.549
He's just drinking alcohol.

17:22.882 --> 17:25.176
Seriously, you scared me.

17:25.385 --> 17:27.387
Good thing it's nothing major.

17:27.804 --> 17:29.805
Hey, are you okay?

17:29.806 --> 17:31.975
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3

17:35.061 --> 17:38.314
This guy dipped his junk in Spirytus
the other day just to drink it.

17:38.481 --> 17:39.690
You're kidding!

17:39.691 --> 17:41.108
Are you stupid?

17:41.109 --> 17:43.736
Even we wouldn't do something like that.

17:47.198 --> 17:48.408
You wouldn't, right?

17:48.866 --> 17:50.952
Don't give me that
serious stare of concern.

17:51.744 --> 17:54.955
If you guys were in my shoes,
you would've done the same thing!

17:54.956 --> 17:56.373
No, we wouldn't.

17:56.374 --> 18:00.295
What kind of situation leads to
"dipping your junk in Spirytus" anyway?

18:03.047 --> 18:03.590
Oh.

18:03.923 --> 18:05.091
What is it, Nojima?

18:06.342 --> 18:08.219
I'm gonna go
"pick some flowers" real quick.

18:10.179 --> 18:12.431
With that face,
you're calling it picking flowers?

18:12.432 --> 18:14.892
If you're taking a dump,
just say you're taking a dump.

18:15.059 --> 18:17.228
This guy is seriously gross sometimes.

18:17.645 --> 18:19.980
Probably around 28 days a month, right?

18:19.981 --> 18:22.025
So in February, he's like that every day.

18:25.403 --> 18:29.824
Hanging out with this crowd
is ruining my noble image.

18:37.457 --> 18:40.168
Many people think a washlet
isn't necessary.

18:40.376 --> 18:42.712
But I'm definitely in the
"it's necessary" camp.

18:43.338 --> 18:44.421
Now then...

18:44.422 --> 18:45.423
STOP / BUTT WASH

18:49.427 --> 18:54.140
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMEN
DRY / STRONG WASH

18:59.896 --> 19:01.856
The water won't stop.

19:02.815 --> 19:06.653
Why? I could turn it on,
so why won't it turn off?

19:06.944 --> 19:09.739
Why do you keep spraying
against my will?

19:10.323 --> 19:15.787
This is just like the main character
in a mecha anime!

19:17.246 --> 19:20.083
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMENDammit, the water won't stop spraying!

19:20.667 --> 19:21.834
Just as I thought.

19:34.514 --> 19:36.974
What's going on?
What the hell happened!?

19:37.725 --> 19:40.228
STRONG WASH

19:40.812 --> 19:44.315
Why is that the only button that works?!

19:45.274 --> 19:47.777
Dammit, it still won't stop!

19:47.902 --> 19:49.654
I want to scream for help, but...

19:50.697 --> 19:52.656
Nojima exposing his lower half?

19:52.657 --> 19:55.826
Even if it's a machine malfunction,
exposing such a pathetic state is...

19:55.827 --> 19:57.077
Such a let down.

19:57.078 --> 20:00.540
- I thought you were a noble person.
- My noble image...

20:01.457 --> 20:02.834
I'll try pressing it again.

20:03.459 --> 20:07.505
STRONG WASH

20:09.006 --> 20:12.969
PRESS TWICE FOR SUPER POWER SPRAY

20:16.848 --> 20:18.849
Wait, calm down!

20:18.850 --> 20:21.435
Your spraying power is too much for me!

20:21.436 --> 20:23.228
I'm begging you, please stop.

20:23.229 --> 20:25.606
I can't take this anymore.

20:33.531 --> 20:34.615
Did it stop?

20:35.450 --> 20:38.494
BIDET FOR WOMEN

20:44.000 --> 20:47.336
What the hell is this!?

20:49.005 --> 20:51.007
I can't take it anymore.

20:51.382 --> 20:53.009
I'm going crazy.

20:53.468 --> 20:55.845
Do I really have to call for help?

21:01.684 --> 21:03.352
No, not yet!

21:03.978 --> 21:04.144
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMEN DRY / STRONG WASH

21:04.145 --> 21:08.565
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMEN DRY / STRONG WASH
The washlet runs on electricity, so if I cut the power, it'll stop.

21:08.566 --> 21:08.940
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMEN DRY / STRONG WASH

21:08.941 --> 21:10.776
STOP / BUTT WASH / BIDET FOR WOMEN DRY / STRONG WASH
And since this device doesn't use batteries,

21:10.777 --> 21:10.984
And since this device doesn't use batteries,

21:10.985 --> 21:13.821
I just need to unplug it
and everything will be solved.

21:14.697 --> 21:16.783
I'm not going down without a fight!

21:18.367 --> 21:20.661
