22:56.757 --> 22:58.758
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

22:58.759 --> 22:59.593
Wa wa wa

22:59.594 --> 23:01.553
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

23:01.554 --> 23:02.262
Wa wa wa wa

